Package: accbaseballr
Title: ACC Baseball Datasets with Advanced Sabermetric Metrics
Version: 0.1.4
Authors@R: 
    person("Hana", "Baskin", , "hana.baskin@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Provides curated ACC (Atlantic Coast Conference) baseball
    datasets at the player-season level, including traditional statistics
    and advanced sabermetric metrics such as weighted on-base average
    (wOBA), weighted runs created plus (wRC+), and fielding-independent
    pitching (FIP).
